e"]}," a dress."]},{"id":"f5","segments":["The suit ",{"id":"f5g","answers":["looks"],"options":["looks like","looks"]}," good."]},{"id":"f6","segments":["This hat ",{"id":"f6g","answers":["looks like"],"options":["looks like","looks"]}," a flower."]}]}},{"role":"rule","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"a12w4l2-discovery-homework-rule","kind":"rule-page","title":"look / looks + adjective","blocks":[{"type":"rule","title":"look / looks + adjective","text":"Используем, когда говорим, каким выглядит предмет.","examples":["The coat looks nice.","The hats look strange."]},{"type":"rule","title":"look / looks like + noun","text":"Используем, когда говорим, на что предмет похож.","examples":["The blouse looks like a shirt.","The hat looks like a flower."]},{"type":"rule","title":"look / looks","formula":"it / the coat → looks\nthey / the coats → look"},{"type":"rule","title":"Questions","text":"How does it look? → Как это выглядит?\nWhat does it look like? → На что это похоже?\n\nОдин предмет: does\nНесколько предметов: do"},{"type":"rule","title":"After like","text":"Перед одним исчисляемым существительным нужен a/an.","examples":["It looks like a coat.","It looks like an old coat."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"L2-homework-1","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English.","instruction":"Переведите на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Эта блузка очень яркая.","acceptedAnswers":["This blouse is very bright.","This blouse''s very bright.","This blouse is very bright","This blouse’s very bright.","This blouse''s very bright"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"2","prompt":"Те костюмы действительно простые.","acceptedAnswers":["Those suits are really plain.","Those suits are really simple.","Those suits are really plain","Those suits are really simple"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"3","prompt":"Этот свитер слишком тёмный.","acceptedAnswers":["This sweater is too dark.","This 