ful.","Emma is polite and helpful","She is polite and helpful.","She is polite and helpful","She''s polite and helpful.","She''s polite and helpful","She’s polite and helpful.","She’s polite and helpful"],"normalization":"translation"}]},{"version":1,"id":"L4-homework-2","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"instruction":"Переведите вопросы и ответы на английский.","items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Как выглядит Бен?","placeholder":"Ben","acceptedAnswers":["What does Ben look like?","What does Ben look like"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"2","prompt":"У Бена короткие светлые волосы.","placeholder":"Ben","acceptedAnswers":["Ben has short blonde hair.","Ben has short blonde hair","He has short blonde hair.","He has short blonde hair"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"3","prompt":"Какая Лили?","placeholder":"Lily","acceptedAnswers":["What is Lily like?","What is Lily like","What''s Lily like?","What''s Lily like","What’s Lily like?","What’s Lily like"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"4","prompt":"Лили тихая.","placeholder":"Lily","acceptedAnswers":["Lily is quiet.","Lily is quiet","She is quiet.","She is quiet","She''s quiet.","She''s quiet","She’s quiet.","She’s quiet"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"5","prompt":"Какой Макс?","placeholder":"Max","acceptedAnswers":["What is Max like?","What is Max like","What''s Max like?","What''s Max like","What’s Max like?","What’s Max like"],"normalization":"translation"},{"id":"6","prompt":"Макс ленивый.","placeholder":"Max","acceptedAnswers":["Max is lazy.","Max is lazy","He is lazy.","He is lazy","He''s lazy.","He''s lazy","He’s lazy.","He’s lazy"],"normalization":"translation"}]}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(lesson_id) do update set definition=excluded.definition;
